message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: trace-thread
abstract: >-
  Links one payment's legs across UETR, end-to-end IDs, ACH trace numbers,
  Fedwire IMAD/OMAD, FedNow and RTP IDs and stablecoin mint and burn, marks
  where the identifier trail breaks, and tests recall and hold policies on a
  taint model. Engineering checklist, not legal advice.
